WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:10.160
Submit your fanart to the Soul Contract producers here at: soulcontractanime.tumblr.com/submit

00:01:46.832 --> 00:01:50.775
Soul Contract

00:01:52.131 --> 00:01:55.366
15th Contract

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.020
WARNING: Don't drink or eat when you watch this episode!
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.800
One-armed Skilled Master Yang Zicheng

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.740
When I heard of this name

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.680
A whole mountain of youkais trembled

00:02:07.707 --> 00:02:11.095
No wonder Duanmu Xi chose him

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.890
Don't get carried away

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.660
Youkai lady

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.380
The favor of chopping hand

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.660
is now returned to you

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:27.460
Although that guy doesn't treat youkais as foes

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.240
but he once subdued the greatest demon in this world

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.370
If not for the short lifespan as a human,

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.240
I'm afraid

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.500
I'd constantly be living under his shadow

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.340
This guy, Yang Jinghua,

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.400
is possibly the descendant of Yang Zicheng

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.300
Enough

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.920
You win this round

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.060
Yangming Master is yours

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.130
Lord Yinzhe

00:02:47.139 --> 00:02:49.937
Even Lord Yinzhe backs off?

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.160
This Yang Jinghua

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.000
What

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.540
Don't wanna go one-on-one?

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.840
One-on-one?

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.800
You're not qualified yet

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.940
This is my fox spirit clan's elixir

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.470
Give it to Yangming Master

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.320
The Duanmu family has changed drastically

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.490
If you ever lose guard of him

00:03:09.493 --> 00:03:12.439
I won't let you get away

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.320
Hey

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.300
Stop

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.880
Duanmu Xi

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.080
That damn red-haired didn't lie to me

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.734
The elixir is working

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.580
Are you alright?

00:03:31.594 --> 00:03:32.870
Sorry

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:33.907
I-I

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.200
Don't speak

00:03:38.392 --> 00:03:39.780
Keep quiet

00:03:39.799 --> 00:03:41.420
and follow me

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:44.300
Your wounds are healed?

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.860
You aren't mad at me?

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.110
Hey, hey

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.500
Bring along the Luoye Sword

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.200
Let's go

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.350
You get changed in the car

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.300
2nd Lady

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.940
They're going out

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.220
Very well

00:04:16.227 --> 00:04:18.617
Let's prepare ourselves

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.600
Duanmu Xi

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.440
Are you really not angry?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.940
I pierced you

00:04:23.948 --> 00:04:24.787
and

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.220
Let's not talk about it

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.440
It's not your problem

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:30.820
I was the one who didn't protect you well

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.520
Anyway, what's with your sucky clothes?

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.180
Didn't you say it has great defense

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.440
It didn't work at all

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.720
It only works on Spirit Masters like Situ Li

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.220
So it works on witchcrafts

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.720
but not regular attacks?

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:42.890
You don't understand

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.340
Yeah, sure I don't

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.560
You sneak out on midnight

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:47.620
Where you plan to go?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:48.840
To look for my Sifu

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.190
Sifu?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:55.200
He is the only person in the world who knows most about the Luoye Sword

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.490
How did you know?

00:05:03.814 --> 00:05:06.013
You come with me to meet him

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:09.410
You wanna look for your Sifu to ask about the sword?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.420
It's already so late, why need to bother?

00:05:12.422 --> 00:05:13.406
Xi

00:05:13.783 --> 00:05:17.077
It's been a while you haven't come to see Sifu

00:05:17.077 --> 00:05:18.842
A blind man?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:20.570
Sifu

00:05:20.578 --> 00:05:22.124
Your disciple is here

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.520
to beg you for something

00:05:25.301 --> 00:05:26.680
To beg me?

00:05:26.691 --> 00:05:28.660
You know the rules

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.920
I still remember in my heart everything that you taught

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.450
In equal exchange

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.200
Right

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.660
Give me your precious item

00:05:39.664 --> 00:05:40.661
or

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.480
Or win against you once

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.176
What's going on?

00:05:57.176 --> 00:05:58.895
Why a sudden duel?

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.540
You're wounded

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.840
You can't win against me now

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.280
Try again next time

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.440
I can't wait for next time

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.080
In that case

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.800
I'll let you think over

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.460
if you really want to trade with me

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.670
Sifu

00:06:21.676 --> 00:06:24.052
I've got nothing

00:06:24.052 --> 00:06:26.210
to trade with an equal price

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.490
This kind of boisterous attitude

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.800
is unlike you, whom I used to know

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.170
Because

00:06:32.179 --> 00:06:34.318
I have a reason I must fight

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.840
Duanmu, watch out

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.220
You struggle a lot

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.080
yet you don't evade

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.220
You thought I

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.120
won't dare to sever your arm?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.230
You naturally would

00:07:04.238 --> 00:07:05.477
but

00:07:05.477 --> 00:07:07.082
no matter what

00:07:07.082 --> 00:07:08.864
I'm winning

00:07:13.756 --> 00:07:14.554
Xi

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.660
Duanmu Xi

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.860
How did you get such a bad injury?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.100
He fought so fiercely against you just now

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.940
of course his wounds get worse

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.560
Tell me who injured you?

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.780
Your Sifu will avenge for you

00:07:33.783 --> 00:07:36.393
Aren't you the one who did it?

00:07:36.662 --> 00:07:37.520
Qiu

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.900
Go get some medicine to help your fellow apprentice

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:40.780
Sure

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.150
Tell me

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.980
why you want to get yourself killed?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.800
What exactly

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.020
do you want from me?

00:07:52.083 --> 00:07:53.349
That sword

00:07:55.467 --> 00:07:57.245
Sacred Sword Luoye

00:07:57.245 --> 00:08:00.667
A blessed weapon passed down by the Duanmu family

00:08:00.667 --> 00:08:01.651
Known as

00:08:01.651 --> 00:08:03.166
a Weapon of Blessing

00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:04.729
used at the altar

00:08:04.729 --> 00:08:06.122
What's the matter?

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:08.900
If the power of the sword is sealed,

00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:10.213
what will happen?

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.310
If so

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.388
then

00:08:13.388 --> 00:08:15.495
you're injured by the Luoye?

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.600
Sealing the spirit

00:08:19.602 --> 00:08:21.172
I'm afraid

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:24.040
you'll have to destroy that person's soul

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.490
Is there any other way?

00:08:26.493 --> 00:08:28.904
I've already answered your question

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.600
If you want to ask more,

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.070
you'll have to beat me again

00:08:32.074 --> 00:08:34.151
Sifu, you're such a meanie!

00:08:34.151 --> 00:08:35.010
Otherwise,

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.651
you can exchange your item that you view precious

00:08:37.651 --> 00:08:38.683
I've said it already

00:08:38.683 --> 00:08:39.855
my stuffs were

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.520
all given by the Duanmu family

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.080
I've got nothing

00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:44.686
You do have

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:48.460
That spirit standing outside the house

00:08:48.464 --> 00:08:50.825
must be your most precious item, right?

00:08:50.825 --> 00:08:54.090
He still doesn't know anything

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.124
Yeah

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.450
Wait here, I'll go see him

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.670
Sifu

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:04.650
Qiu

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.600
Look after him

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:07.400
Yes

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.690
Sifu

00:09:09.691 --> 00:09:10.651
Wait up

00:09:12.664 --> 00:09:13.772
Don't worry

00:09:13.772 --> 00:09:16.315
I won't go overboard

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.060
This sword is yours, isn't it?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.360
You can see me?

00:09:28.378 --> 00:09:29.505
Of course

00:09:29.505 --> 00:09:31.617
You are Xi's Soul Image

00:09:31.617 --> 00:09:33.160
If you can win against me

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.644
then it's for his sake

00:09:37.832 --> 00:09:39.331
What are you up to?

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.940
Be careful, mister

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.640
I'm making a move

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:47.020
Hey

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.140
Wait a sec

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.580
This is just a bit of punishment for wounding my disciple

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.940
Enough with Qin Siyao or that damn red-haired

00:09:53.941 --> 00:09:55.678
Even you wanna lecture me too?

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.560
Damn it

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.440
Duanmu Xi himself never said anything

00:09:58.442 --> 00:10:00.849
You all just wanna take turns blaming me

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.300
You're all f*cking annoying

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:19.100
If you wanna avenge for your beloved disciple

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.140
Come on

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.120
I owe no one, not even Duanmu Xi

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.440
You can't get out of bed

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.001
Xi

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.720
Why are you up?

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:34.860
Sifu

00:10:36.589 --> 00:10:38.276
Lie down quick

00:10:38.276 --> 00:10:40.386
If you fall right here

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.600
How will I explain to the Duanmu family

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.320
He said

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.800
he's worried about your safety

00:10:49.321 --> 00:10:50.522
Indeed

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.120
he is a magnificent Soul Image

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.120
I fear that

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.220
he himself doesn't know how great he is

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.200
Hey, Duanmu Xi

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:01.620
if you wanna ask

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.900
just ask

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.820
Doesn't matter how many times you ask

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.980
I'll win all rounds for you

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.440
You sly fox

00:11:08.443 --> 00:11:11.099
I will keep you company right till the end

00:11:11.099 --> 00:11:12.273
Hey, hey

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.440
Do you need to be so engrossed?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.550
Yang Jinghua

00:11:15.553 --> 00:11:17.020
You look...

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.460
Cool, isn't it?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:21.360
I become like this after fighting with red-haired

00:11:21.396 --> 00:11:22.318
Sifu

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.930
Since he has won,

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.802
please answer my second question

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:27.780
Alright

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.740
The sword is sealed once sheathed

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.370
Unsheath then it gets unsealed

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:37.120
But

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.030
Sifu

00:11:38.032 --> 00:11:40.063
The scabbard of Luoye sword

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.130
If I remember clearly

00:11:44.139 --> 00:11:45.611
It should be...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.150
This is all that I can say

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.440
The rest

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.420
will depend on your own luck
